## Email sent to the submitter to inform that an error occurred when generating the PDF attestation email.
## Parameters:  - {0} Date and time
##              - {1} Submitter name
##              - {2} MyDIAL.mem page url
##              - {3} item UUID
##              - {4} Error stacktrace
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <link href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Montserrat' rel='stylesheet':>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .timestamp {
        text-align:right;
      }
      .language {
        font-style: italic;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .metadata-table th, .metadata-table td, .metadata-table tr {
        margin: 0;
      }
      .metadata-table th {
        width: 25%;
        min-width: 150px;
        font-weight: bold;
        background-color: #EEE;
        text-align: left;
        padding-right: 10px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p style="margin:20px">
      <img src="https://uclouvain.be/sites/all/themes/ucltheme/logo.png?newdesign2018"/>
    </p>
    <p class="timestamp">${params[0]}</p>
    <div class="language" style="border-bottom:1px solid #777; color: #777;">
      Version française (English version below)
    </div>
    <p>Madame/Monsieur ${params[1]},</p>
    <p>Nous somme navré de vous annoncer qu'une erreur s'est produite lors de la génération de votre attestation au format PDF.</p>
    <p>Voici des informations qui pourraient être utiles à nos équipes:</p>
    <h4>Date et heure de l'incident:</h4>
    ${params[0]}
    <h4>ID de l'item:</h4>
    ${params[3]}
    <h4>Description technique de l'erreur:</h4>
    <pre style="border:1px solid #777; background-color:#EEE">${params[4]}</pre>
    <p>Veuillez contacter le support DIAL à l'adresse ${config.get("mail.helpdesk")}.</p>
    <p>Vous pouvez également essayer de télécharger l'attestation manuellement depuis votre page <a href="$params[2]">MyDIAL.mem</a>.
    <p>L'équipe ${config.get('dspace.name')}.</p>

    <div class="language" style="border-bottom:1px solid #777; color: #777;">
      English version
    </div>
    <p>Dear ${params[1]},</p>
    <p>We are sorry to announce you that an error occurred while generating your submission PDF attestation.</p>
    <p>Here are some information that might be useful for our team:</p>
    <h4>Date and time of error:</h4>
    ${params[0]}
    <h4>Item's UUID:</h4>
    ${params[3]}
    <h4>Technical error description:</h4>
    <pre style="border:1px solid #777; background-color:#EEE">${params[4]}</pre>
    <p>Please contact our team for support at ${config.get("mail.helpdesk")}.</p>
    <p>You can also try to download the attestation manually from your <a href="$params[2]">MyDIAL.mem</a> page.
    <p>The ${config.get('dspace.name')} team.</p>
  </body>
</html>